WEBVTT - Class 1 English Mridang Chapter 5: A Farm

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:45.000
<v Teacher Tara>Cock-a-doodle-doo! The sun rises over the red barn. The farm is waking up with cheerful greetings from all our animal friends!

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:30.000
<v Teacher Tara>The gentle brown cow chews sweet grass: "Moo, moo!" Fluffy white sheep bound across the pasture: "Baa, baa!"

00:01:30.000 --> 00:02:15.000
<v Teacher Tara>Cluck, cluck! Mother hen pecks for seeds while four tiny golden chicks wobble behind her. Look how she keeps them safe under her warm wings!

00:02:15.000 --> 00:03:00.000
<v Teacher Tara>Farmer Ravi pours cool, clear water into clean troughs. When we care for animals with love and kindness, our whole farm flourishes!

